{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014320/extras/ea1b61cad9c9ed6121bbb8807fe133d5.poster.avif?t=1764898158\" width=616 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014320/extras/ea1b61cad9c9ed6121bbb8807fe133d5.webm?t=1764898158\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014320/extras/ea1b61cad9c9ed6121bbb8807fe133d5.mp4?t=1764898158\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start from zero and discover the newest entry in the OCTOPATH TRAVELER series. Experience a story of restoration and retribution over the divine rings\u2014an epic saga that unfolds across the realm of Orsterra.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy familiar features such as the series' HD-2D graphics, a fusion of retro pixel art and 3DCG; the player's ability to roleplay using Path Actions of their choice; and the Break and Boost system that can turn the tide of battle. Additionally, brand-new features such as character creation and town building allow you to create your own character and restore your hometown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014320/extras/8e8910ac7bcfaab9f81167fd1d68efb9.avif?t=1764898158\" width=616 height=173 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Key Features]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > You are the protagonist of the story. Choose your appearance, voice, motions, and favorite dish with the new character creation feature!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Restore your hometown through town building. Invite companions and allies to live in a town of your creation!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Engage in exhilarating and strategic command battles. Choose from over 30 allies to form a party comprised of up to eight characters!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Use Path Actions to invite people to your town, engage in battle, and obtain items. Where you go and what you do is entirely up to you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Equip action skills with the new skill system. These skills can be learned by allies and passed on to others.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"A Story All Your Own","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3014320/2673874420d48acf72fa76c2998e59b63a2ee69c.jpg"},{"name":"First Break","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3014320/45127a2edc5bc2670a83d066283f746a2d9539e2.jpg"},{"name":"Max Boost","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3014320/6c506498c57a281528a3f40c79dc4e146b4fb119.jpg"},{"name":"A New Skill","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3014320/6dcf2dda840995c2f6b00e0e78aca0802c8bc49c.jpg"},{"name":"Octopath Battler","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3014320/dfd99027e51612a3dfda8bd68a0e5e2bb581ce51.jpg"},{"name":"Ring of the Flamebringer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3014320/aa9cacab0af1cbe2a598ec9ce613250092832fd0.jpg"},{"name":"Ring of the Huntress","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3014320/1c805252f2d1258fb7e8ba4a95c3556c2326b77a.jpg"},{"name":"Ring of the Thunderblade","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3014320/f400d32f094bc24f93e89a7e7f8404ab046eccde.jpg"},{"name":"Ring of the Prince of Thieves","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3014320/ffeb24e8dd50552141e083cd88d19dbf2216ada6.jpg"},{"name":"Ring of the Scholarking","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3014320/d207c63d31d109cc8a56183801231fc2e47dd31e.jpg"}],"total":37},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3014320?t=1764898158","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014320/afb10728a77fc50834697e5baa5c436ebf4e667f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764898158","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014320/67b817b83633861c6330061838917bcc07be9852/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764898158","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014320/67b817b83633861c6330061838917bcc07be9852/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764898158","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Trading Cards","id":29},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,2,5],"notes":"Please note that gameplay includes content that is not suitable for all ages, such as violence."},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3014330,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>OCTOPATH TRAVELER 0 Digital Deluxe Edition</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014320/extras/2f13912bd734f6e3e6a9074369dea3cc.avif?t=1764898158\" width=616 height=202 /></span></p>This set is a bundle of the OCTOPATH TRAVELER 0 base game, Deluxe Travel Provisions, and digital art book.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Contents of the Digital Deluxe Version</h2><ol><li><strong>OCTOPATH TRAVELER 0 Base Game</strong><br></li><li><strong>Deluxe Travel Provisions</strong><br>\u25bc Action Skills<br>- Triple Strike Mastery<br>- SP Saver Mastery<br>- Extra JP Mastery<br>\u25bc Consumable Items: 8 Types of Nuts (M)<br>- Fortifying Nut (M)<br>- Magic Nut (M)<br>- Tough Nut (M)<br>- Resistant Nut (M)<br>- Light Nut (M)<br>- Critical Nut (M)<br>- Sharp Nut (M)<br>- Slippery Nut (M)<br>\u25bc Town Decorations: Festive Decoration Designs<br>- Table with Roasted Chicken<br>- Festive Arch<br>- Large Festive Arch<br>- Festive Flag<br>- Grand Vase<br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014320/extras/a0f2914be88ea673f52e2a8fde23907a.avif?t=1764898158\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p></li><li><strong>Digital Art Book</strong></li></ol></p><br><h1>Instructions for Accessing the Digital Art Book</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014320/extras/15088de13d3058e0c63b06f14a927699.avif?t=1764898158\" width=616 height=347 /></span></p></p><br><h1>OCTOPATH TRAVELER 0 Prologue Demo</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014320/extras/5dc07c242cd0e404b190750626476152.avif?t=1764898158\" width=616 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A free demo is now available! You can create your own character, play for three hours, and carry over your saved game to the full game. Travel beyond starting areas is restricted, but you can explore those corners of Orsterra as you wish. Play through the story, build your town, or search for allies to accompany you. Embark on an adventure of your own creation.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014320/extras/ea1b61cad9c9ed6121bbb8807fe133d5.poster.avif?t=1764898158\" width=616 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014320/extras/ea1b61cad9c9ed6121bbb8807fe133d5.webm?t=1764898158\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014320/extras/ea1b61cad9c9ed6121bbb8807fe133d5.mp4?t=1764898158\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start from zero and discover the newest entry in the OCTOPATH TRAVELER series. Experience a story of restoration and retribution over the divine rings\u2014an epic saga that unfolds across the realm of Orsterra.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy familiar features such as the series' HD-2D graphics, a fusion of retro pixel art and 3DCG; the player's ability to roleplay using Path Actions of their choice; and the Break and Boost system that can turn the tide of battle. Additionally, brand-new features such as character creation and town building allow you to create your own character and restore your hometown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014320/extras/8e8910ac7bcfaab9f81167fd1d68efb9.avif?t=1764898158\" width=616 height=173 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Key Features]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > You are the protagonist of the story. Choose your appearance, voice, motions, and favorite dish with the new character creation feature!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Restore your hometown through town building. Invite companions and allies to live in a town of your creation!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Engage in exhilarating and strategic command battles. Choose from over 30 allies to form a party comprised of up to eight characters!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Use Path Actions to invite people to your town, engage in battle, and obtain items. Where you go and what you do is entirely up to you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Equip action skills with the new skill system. These skills can be learned by allies and passed on to others.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Square Enix","DOKIDOKI GROOVE WORKS"],"dlc":[3825480],"drm_notice":"Denuvo Anti-tamper","genres":[{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014320/64e57769c968124451e35898eae64217f99bd9c4/header.jpg?t=1764898158","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 SQUARE ENIX","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3014320/734462553/02b1ff191bfd7139801b55ce75f281169c08621e/1753472066/dash_av1.mpd?t=1753977573","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3014320/734462553/02b1ff191bfd7139801b55ce75f281169c08621e/1753472066/dash_h264.mpd?t=1753977573","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3014320/734462553/02b1ff191bfd7139801b55ce75f281169c08621e/1753472066/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1753977573","id":257174113,"name":"PEGI EN Announce","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257174113/4345ae3223b2e5f0b72411c7f8f8919c48a363c1/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1753977573"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3014320/336913395/79e2